            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "صبح کے وقت اسٹیشن پر رش ہوتا ہے۔ subah ke vaqt isṭeshan par rash hotā hai. The station is very crowded in the mornings."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Everyday spoken Urdu; news reports and notices write ہجوم (hujūm), \"a crowd\"."
            }
          ]
        },
